  "notes": [
    "Tool names are case-sensitive and must match Antigravity built-in tool identifiers.",
    "The tool allowlist controls which tools are exposed to an agent. commandExecutionPolicy controls shell execution behavior and does not grant missing tools.",
    "The Team Orchestrator is the only agent granted invoke_subagent and manage_subagents for centralized delegation.",
    "UI/UX is intentionally not granted run_command; it can inspect source and write design artifacts.",
    "Keep this policy synchronized with modules/*/agents/*.md and the generated root agents/*.md bundle."
  ]
}
